---
const stats = [
  { value: "5+", label: "Years experience" },
  { value: "5", label: "Companies" },
  { value: "2024", label: "Currently at Eteration" },
];
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label reveal">About</span>

    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        Having 6 years of frontend development experience in React ecosystem with TypeScript, 
        I have been specialized in Next.js and global state management using Redux Toolkit.
        My work prioritizes semantic markup and accessible web experiences for all users along 
        with presenting responsive user interfaces which appears perfectly on smaller size devices.
      </p>
      <p>
        Additionally, I have been expanding my expertise into DevOps and the software lifecycle.
        Having knowledge of Docker and container orchestration. I earned my CKAD certificate to 
        master Kubernetes applications, recently.
        These skills help me contribute more effectively to cross-functional teams.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stats reveal">
      {
        stats.map((stat) => (
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">{stat.value}</span>
            <span class="stat-label">{stat.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <hr class="divider reveal" />

    <p class="codepen-line reveal">
      Also on{" "}
      <a
        href="https://codepen.io/helvaci-mert"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="codepen-link"
        aria-label="View CodePen profile (opens in new tab)"
      >
        CodePen
        <svg
          width="12"
          height="12"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"/>
          <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: var(--section-padding) 0;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
    padding: calc(var(--section-padding) / 2) 0;
    padding-block-start: 0;
  }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .codepen-line {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .codepen-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .codepen-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about {
      padding: var(--section-padding-mobile) 0;
    }

    .stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
